SPL -- the print spooler's queue directory==========================================splman (the manager), splprt (the printer process) and splstat (the statusreport) all open /DD/SPL/splq.  Without the directory and the file they eachstopped at error 216, path-not-found, and said nothing.splq is here and EMPTY: an empty queue is the correct state for a spoolerwith nothing to print.